      "interpretation": "An account holder may manage the lines of household members listed under authorized_lines in their profile. This is a PERMIT condition: the account holder (Dana Whitfield, C2044) may access/manage lines that appear in the authorized_lines array of their household profile.",
      "modality": "PERMIT"
